  "body": "- feat(outline): add Java annotation type and element rules [`#2955`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2955)\n- fix(outline): report Java private/protected fields in the outline [`#2950`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2950)\n- feat(outline): add Java enum member rule [`#2954`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2954)\n- chore(deps): update dependency @types/node to v24.19.1 [`#2983`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2983)\n- chore(deps): update dependency dprint to v0.60.1 [`#2984`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2984)\n- feat(outline): add Java module declaration rule [`#2956`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2956)\n- chore(deps): update rust crate termimad to v0.35.5 [`#2925`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2925)\n- chore(deps): update rust crate napi-derive to v3.6.10 [`#2936`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2936)\n- chore(deps): update dependency @napi-rs/cli to v3.10.6 [`#2922`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2922)\n- chore(deps): update dependency chalk to v6.0.1 [`#2979`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2979)\n- chore(deps): update rust crate tokio to v1.53.2 [`#2981`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2981)\n- chore(deps): update rust crate thiserror to v2.0.21 [`#2966`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2966)\n- chore(deps): update dependency oxlint to v1.86.0 [`#2967`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2967)\n- chore(deps): update rust crate smallvec to v1.16.2 [`#2968`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2968)\n- feat(outline): add Java wildcard-import outline rules [`#2948`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2948)\n- fix(outline): capture C/C++ declarator identifier names [`#2946`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2946)\n- feat(cli): add trust and revoke custom language policies [`#2972`](https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep/pull/2972)\n- refactor(cli): extract custom language policy [`#2977`](htt